{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d1/tf4md7j6zbnbjxi4wj1wimj5sxyb8tk.mp3","text":"战场报告，我能帮您整理。文书辞令，我写得也不算差。您要休息的时候我会站岗。您还有要求？......不，我希望您不要让我闲下来。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/t9bt63nc250u0g94wd3huyqu6frihz9.mp3","text":"风笛和你们待在一起的时候，还经常哼歌吗？......我？我比较习惯安静地欣赏音乐。由号角所发出的，只能是冲锋的指令——这是句玩笑，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/10/socfm0qa2dm1qryz97s89253jp6hjiv.mp3","text":"“白狼”这个称呼，和阿斯兰称王的历史一样悠久，不过，您为什么对这件事感兴趣？......啊，您之前看见......我的獠牙了？抱歉，那是我失态了，我会在今后避免犯相同的错误。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/m7s1wdgmjoxedpjqjebqnisu5qnpw70.mp3","text":"我的字很好看？......谢谢，只是贵族修饰门面的花架子罢了，我不喜欢这些。不过，现在我偶尔会很感激它——当我拿着笔，别的什么也不想，只是在想如何写好每一个字母的时候。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/43jfphlqjotdu4plc52uz2n5vd4trzk.mp3","text":"那座城镇从它的伤口吐出大片黑色晶簇时，我曾以为一切都已经无药可医......罗德岛的博士，你们熟悉那些并非天灾，而是人祸致使的感染者吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/96h1ytdpyzur2gn7nv8xb9jhqb5h3xt.mp3","text":"那位叫作Misery的罗德岛干员两次救出了我，我由衷地感激他。我不会问“为什么得救的是我”，谁活下来了，谁就要背着那些没有得救的人的愿望往前走。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:4/45/rswzqtnblw9n802wd60ixid0gs3p45y.mp3","text":"幽暗的室内环境总让我觉得很压抑。您想出去走走吗，博士？虽然天空灰蒙蒙的，但至少能吹到风。有时候，风里会传来歌声，而不是自己说话的回声。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/mrkldwen19kyixaafraw3qgh58v04ir.mp3","text":"我隐约能想起厅堂上祖辈们戴满军功章的肖像，铭刻着狮王训令的重剑，还有父亲植在前院的槭树......但也只有这些了。我已经很久没有回过家了。维多利亚的乱局中，军人没有告假的时间。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/28/s5wcr96qqa3bsossmdap7542e9a8ffl.mp3","text":"博士，您这样优秀的指挥官，会悲伤吗？会愤怒吗？会......仇恨吗？我尽力不被个人情绪左右，但是我没办法忘记。我答应过他们我不会忘记。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/9aj6zltu6g7tvpkx5aq2aktmr45klsj.mp3","text":"......见过了那么多惨象，你是怎么还能睡着的？......如果我也能这样，只是合上双眼，我会感觉好一些吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/20w321a5alrq7czl2um6j0ws2tcjufs.mp3","text":"风暴突击队队长号角，向您报到，罗德岛的博士。我已经见识了您的手段，还有罗德岛干员的作战素质。在接下来的合作中，我和我的士兵会听从您的指挥。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/n86fqnlydxg2b62w8bvhxizi8vx12o8.mp3","text":"演习训练永远不够。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/jmtfio2k703657r1ovbo1nz5ya4ga93.mp3","text":"谢谢，我会视作对我表现的嘉奖，而不是对我身份的重视。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:3/35/m1qvui365x60viqsybhqqh6ljychvdw.mp3","text":"把你们代表军衔的标识授予我吧。我愿意......我必须负担起更多人的期望。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/nn8pouoizwm0ej17c8xbz7m6b3ymi7p.mp3","text":"维多利亚的军人应以自己的纪律为傲。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/qf3debxg4i7y1impnpvcuyi3oe1h6ac.mp3","text":"任何时候，我相信我的战友，希望你们也同样信任我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:7/76/myohx2jcphdqliyk3bj0pl1est7z732.mp3","text":"我们没有时间犹豫，火线背后还有人等着我们。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/b5y7k5aok3j2vfqyht3fto68aaox5gr.mp3","text":"我会撑起盾，不要站到我的前面。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:7/78/9tw4wics2povzv6rgwz9kxm2msygbyy.mp3","text":"让我在这场战斗中学习您的指挥方式吧，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/da/iu3krghvq0ssrdf4g65oaunnxxpyhc7.mp3","text":"随时准备入列。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/np6iifwjmhjwa0f7onlppw1mov3kie3.mp3","text":"收到指令。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/74/p78ofabr0kq75c8flqk65bi921xhs6y.mp3","text":"我会完成作战任务。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/enfgvknmx7ej8ef6v0dbd7l4ueab1df.mp3","text":"风暴必须摧毁一切障碍。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/de/dhb2arkzqswyavx904i684nnuh0livt.mp3","text":"来，试试越过我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5d/kjtgh7pxvxfzo5m67stjwmbkbomsaox.mp3","text":"我会向你分享我听过的那些号哭。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/45tzizh2zwzpckctnwcgeslsei1yigj.mp3","text":"你想打倒我？凭什么？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/bhpdiynmadzcqyqk39khmzpcoggi3pn.mp3","text":"一场胜利也许不足以影响整场战争，但至少能让更多的人看到天空。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/a9cvch6pg9uvnjjy2wghk183mj05hqc.mp3","text":"目标已压制。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/gcslfu4dg6vn8su2cgc8m712odzoq4m.mp3","text":"任何对敌人的仁慈都会成为潜伏的祸患，让我带着我的士兵们去解决。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/rwp8h01ryq1xy6bmvz9pey92l25b1v8.mp3","text":"放心，博士，在您带走其他人之前，我不会倒下。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/tlewwn2bfrhhs94kj4vexu4v8smg2tq.mp3","text":"这里不像维多利亚，但......让我想起在皇家近卫学校念书的时候。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5f/luj33p1fj2mvqo5t5gsp45ovjdm66aw.mp3","text":"抱歉，我不习惯卸下武器。您刚刚有撞伤吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e3/151mo5zsvngryn1juysegnapcr88cwm.mp3","text":"嗯？......我只是在看一本普通的小说而已。我已经很久没有看过一页新的文字了，所有的纸页都在战火里被燃烧殆尽了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/gd3vekrnn0qo41n7hjquaoe2rt63njp.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e1/8ny8eqmv133kj1kddlc4cu02f78s4wl.mp3","text":"我被Misery救出来的时候，他告诉我新年已经过去了。那是我错过的第一个新年。那天起，我开始觉得这些节日都无所谓了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/48qirkodgu63ui6k5cbglcq3cpy9l6w.mp3","text":"您好，博士。休息得还好吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4039_horn/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:d/db/1y3crqgq3j3qigdhj5bjlfzaa2vimz0.mp3","text":"战场报告，我能帮您整理。文书辞令，我写得也不算差。您要休息的时候我会站岗。您还有要求？......不，我希望您不要让我闲下来。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/s61mcqfqreg8igtx6ou0xu15v3iifyp.mp3","text":"风笛和你们待在一起的时候，还经常哼歌吗？......我？我比较习惯安静地欣赏音乐。由号角所发出的，只能是冲锋的指令——这是句玩笑，博士。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/88/4kyji3olesrrwhne4io71pn0wrnoedk.mp3","text":"“白狼”这个称呼，和阿斯兰称王的历史一样悠久，不过，您为什么对这件事感兴趣？......啊，您之前看见......我的獠牙了？抱歉，那是我失态了，我会在今后避免犯相同的错误。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/lmxbs9eiiw3mndhqv2qd4exw8asxvpf.mp3","text":"我的字很好看？......谢谢，只是贵族修饰门面的花架子罢了，我不喜欢这些。不过，现在我偶尔会很感激它——当我拿着笔，别的什么也不想，只是在想如何写好每一个字母的时候。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/07/ikubf168u8y3bf6ck6jehbqb6mspy4r.mp3","text":"那座城镇从它的伤口吐出大片黑色晶簇时，我曾以为一切都已经无药可医......罗德岛的博士，你们熟悉那些并非天灾，而是人祸致使的感染者吗？","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/84/hv0ibkoifijvvf38bexej845v9xckha.mp3","text":"那位叫作Misery的罗德岛干员两次救出了我，我由衷地感激他。我不会问“为什么得救的是我”，谁活下来了，谁就要背着那些没有得救的人的愿望往前走。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:5/55/hotr51tih49fkx2l5vt1bt38sgj2bxc.mp3","text":"幽暗的室内环境总让我觉得很压抑。您想出去走走吗，博士？虽然天空灰蒙蒙的，但至少能吹到风。有时候，风里会传来歌声，而不是自己说话的回声。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/41/nw5yxmc3utjf208pcup9o5uifc76cm6.mp3","text":"我隐约能想起厅堂上祖辈们戴满军功章的肖像，铭刻着狮王训令的重剑，还有父亲植在前院的槭树......但也只有这些了。我已经很久没有回过家了。维多利亚的乱局中，军人没有告假的时间。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/50/riw45537tun8w73ag2abkskovi2luin.mp3","text":"博士，您这样优秀的指挥官，会悲伤吗？会愤怒吗？会......仇恨吗？我尽力不被个人情绪左右，但是我没办法忘记。我答应过他们我不会忘记。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:9/93/bboj18v1sq3f7m6imwsrre96pzuxwdn.mp3","text":"......见过了那么多惨象，你是怎么还能睡着的？......如果我也能这样，只是合上双眼，我会感觉好一些吗？","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:d/da/ak9of9xmam8plt12eu3ljswsijp4n34.mp3","text":"风暴突击队队长号角，向您报到，罗德岛的博士。我已经见识了您的手段，还有罗德岛干员的作战素质。在接下来的合作中，我和我的士兵会听从您的指挥。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/gchew64c9j6w6jp4n4h1ymn6ev5gm1m.mp3","text":"演习训练永远不够。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:1/10/ioh9lr3pme1vpaslvr6m744f9ryai9d.mp3","text":"谢谢，我会视作对我表现的嘉奖，而不是对我身份的重视。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/fsnbw4al99lpmk4c2al9kx7qgpy7ydq.mp3","text":"把你们代表军衔的标识授予我吧。我愿意......我必须负担起更多人的期望。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/n2g6vls0zkbv3ylhd2cuylmkuh39hs2.mp3","text":"维多利亚的军人应以自己的纪律为傲。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:4/46/pgrak0makzsdx9bheczqquoi01xvs3d.mp3","text":"任何时候，我相信我的战友，希望你们也同样信任我。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/ceone11mprag1pxtuv3s2f1u3wx59y7.mp3","text":"我们没有时间犹豫，火线背后还有人等着我们。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/rox6fxgv938m9agi33uqg7f81jabcu4.mp3","text":"我会撑起盾，不要站到我的前面。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/kxqb4t6z35u06m34qt6hdjwi7ejpcz9.mp3","text":"让我在这场战斗中学习您的指挥方式吧，博士。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/0rj3eupmmr2fr7x3txsu3u762l3qxcn.mp3","text":"随时准备入列。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/73ln3s0f8fciwmc36gialc5pguzgrm2.mp3","text":"收到指令。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/6ero049py903c6duzzb3j513bm5b2n2.mp3","text":"我会完成作战任务。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/mid3exncfvohpaicj533cb0mii3fmio.mp3","text":"风暴必须摧毁一切障碍。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/2m536tgpf9tg2ba7ax2hpk3z94nv3bf.mp3","text":"来，试试越过我。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/27/0mj0glx4o93gjd9j0xu5jfrniyl1lvp.mp3","text":"我会向你分享我听过的那些号哭。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/su20qdghq7p5476rd9wapyuxy7b37b4.mp3","text":"你想打倒我？凭什么？","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/qqi9u75ji6hva50copfojkng8x2vyne.mp3","text":"一场胜利也许不足以影响整场战争，但至少能让更多的人看到天空。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/9f0cjvc75691fy4396ypja76twhh7jq.mp3","text":"目标已压制。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/egbb5tehnydh30rftf2ng8aa87oz9vr.mp3","text":"任何对敌人的仁慈都会成为潜伏的祸患，让我带着我的士兵们去解决。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:5/51/3pdsmp6fl2qi4hjnrwsupgq3n6tslmm.mp3","text":"放心，博士，在您带走其他人之前，我不会倒下。","alt":"voice/char_4039_horn/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/706rasa6elkes3